# Partner API documentation

When you add or change a route under `/api/v2/business/` that any logged-in partner can call, update `docs/api/partner.md` in the same task.

1. Add one row to the endpoint table.
2. Add a field-level section in the same style as the other endpoints on that page: auth, request, rules, saved fields, success and failure.
3. Add a short line in `docs/api/v2.md` that points at `docs/api/partner.md`. Keep the field-level copy on `partner.md`.
4. Institution-only routes (`/api/v2/business/institution/...`) go in `docs/api/institution.md`, not `partner.md`.
5. If the call changes an order step or a saved column, also update the matching file under `docs/workflows/` or `docs/features/`.

Example: `POST /api/v2/business/pre-ipo/buy` is documented in `docs/api/partner.md`.
